        "id": 1157738
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-22T02:11:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the previous loop I don\u0027t remove the elements from this list while freeing them, so technically it\u0027s not empty when this function exits. We don\u0027t use the list after this function exists but a new user potentially can keep using that list, so I don\u0027t want to leave it with bogus freed elements in it, so figured it would be more fail-safe to explicitly reset it.",
      "parentUuid": "c93f6d47_e910617b",
