      "author": {
        "id": 1275554
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-22T06:27:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand the intention. What I am saying is implementation is messy. Please take a look old kernel example:\n\nhttps://lwn.net/Articles/175432/ \n\nradix_tree_preload\nradix_tree_preload_end\n\nhttps://lxr.missinglinkelectronics.com/linux+v5.16/lib/radix-tree.c#L320\n\nYou would understand how those abstraction will improve the \"list\" management cleaner for all over the places in this implementation.",
      "parentUuid": "a4b52e94_fa89a3a3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 305,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 305,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "18d397439f156f492c919dcd8bb4b94307798864",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
